          "ruleId": "pqscan/recommend/verify",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Ed25519 VERIFY [T2] -> SIG: Add ML-DSA (FIPS 204) verification so that migrated signers can be accepted. NIST IR 8547 defines 'legacy use' as processing already-protected data such as verifying an existing signature; whether Ed25519 verification of already-issued signatures keeps that status after 2035 is set by SP 800-131A (to be revised). Retain legacy verification only for already-issued signatures; do not accept new Ed25519 signatures after the transition."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "cryptography/hazmat/primitives/serialization/ssh.py"
